
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>FastQ Manager</title>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.13.1/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" />
    <!--link rel="stylesheet" href="Content/site.css"-->
	<style>
        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #495057;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .highlight {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0056b3;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
:root {
    --bg: #f6efe6;
    --bg-accent: #fdebd3;
    --ink: #121212;
    --muted: #5c6168;
    --accent: #ff6b35;
    --accent-2: #1f7a6c;
    --accent-3: #f2b705;
    --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
    --border: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.08);
    --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(19, 26, 38, 0.16);
    --radius: 18px;
    --radius-sm: 12px;
    --drawer-width: 200px;
    --drawer-collapsed-width: 95px;
    --font-heading: "Space Grotesk", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
    --font-body: "Source Sans 3", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    
}

* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--ink);
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, #7F7FD5, #91EAE4, #86A8E7); /*W3C, IE 10+/ Edge, Firefox 16+, Chrome 26+, Opera 12+, Safari 7+ */
}

    body::before,
    body::after {
        content: "";
        position: fixed;
        width: 320px;
        height: 320px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(0);
        opacity: 0.45;
        z-index: -1;
    }

    body::before {
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.35), transparent 70%);
        top: -80px;
        right: -120px;
    }

    body::after {
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(31, 122, 108, 0.35), transparent 70%);
        bottom: -120px;
        left: -80px;
    }

button:disabled {cursor: not-allowed; opacity:0.7;}

a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
}

code {
    background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.06);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--drawer-width) 1fr;
    min-height: 100vh;
}

.drawer {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 22px 16px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
    gap: 20px;
    box-shadow: inset -1px 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}

.drawer .brand {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 10px;
}

.brand-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
}

.brand-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00629D;
}

.brand-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
}

.brand-env:not(:empty)  {
    font-size: 14px;
	font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--accent);
	border: solid 1px var(--accent);
	padding: 5px;
}

.logo {
    height: 35px; /* Adjust the logo size as needed */
    width: auto;
    /* Optional: ensure the image doesn't exceed the container height */
    max-height: 100%;
}

.logo-mark {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    /*background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));*/
    background-image: url("/Content/oc_logo.png");
    background-repeat: no-repeat; 
    background-position: center; 
    background-size: contain; 
    background-color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(31, 122, 108, 0.3);
}

.drawer-nav {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    min-height: 0;
    /*padding-right: 6px;*/    
    align-content: start;
}

.drawer-nav .nav-section {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
}

.main-area {
    padding: 20px 20px 60px;
}

.topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
}

.topbar-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 0;
}

.topbar-sub {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
}

.page {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
}

.page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 32px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
}

.card {
    background: var(--card) !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    /*animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both;*/
}

.card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 0;
}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="layout">
                <aside class="drawer">
            <div class="brand">
                <div class="brand-top">
                    <a href="/FastQ" class="logo-container">
                        <img src="https://orangenet.ocfl.net/portals/23/Images/branding/logo_variation_horizontal_small639045190326775680.jpg" alt="Logo" class="logo">
                    </a>
                </div>
                 <div class="brand-title">FastQ Manager</div>
            </div>
            <nav class="drawer-nav">
                <div class="nav-section">                    
                </div>
            </nav>
            <div class="drawer-footer">
            </div>
        </aside>

        <div class="main-area">
            <header class="topbar">
				<div>
					<div class="topbar-title">FastQ Manager</div>
					<div class="topbar-sub">
						FastQ keeps every queue in sync, in real time.
						Book an appointment, watch it instantly appear for the provider, and follow every state change live.
					</div>
				</div>
                <div class="user-chip">
                    
                </div>
            </header>
            <main class="page">
				<div class="card">
					<h1>System Offline</h1>
					<p>The system is currently offline in preparation for our upcoming official launch on Monday, July 20th at 10:00 AM.</p>
					<p class="highlight">Please check back later.</p>
				</div>
            </main>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
